  "body": "v1.12.3\r\n\r\nTimeline\r\n- The controls row names its groups: a small View, Scope, Narrow, Play, with labels and adjusted styling\r\n\r\nDocs\r\n- The readme updated with clearer introduction to the project\r\n\r\nInternal\r\n- The GUI suite on CI installs Chromium alone; the runner image already\r\n  carries its system libraries, and the apt step had been stalling on\r\n  the Ubuntu mirror"
